Query plan:
nl-join (left outer join)
    outer: sscan
               class: o node[?]
               cost:  ? card ?
    inner: sscan
               class: i node[?]
               sargs: term[?] AND term[?] AND term[?]
               cost:  ? card ?
    after: term[?] AND term[?]
    cost:  ? card ?
Query stmt:
select count(*) from t?o o left outer join t?i i on i.a= ?:?  where ?<>nullif(o.x, i.a) and ?<>nullif(o.x, i.a)
